      "observation": "Kings County permitted units fell -32% YoY in 2025 to 6,844 total (6,573 in 5+ unit buildings, only 25 single-family). Per the scope note, this is a lagged, county-wide structural read — not current conditions. The supply pullback modestly supports pricing for 1–3 family stock over the medium term, but the near-zero single-family pipeline is the more relevant shade for this asset type. This shades conviction toward hold rather than wait, but does not flip the verdict.",
